msgid "The assigned IPs will be selected deterministically"
msgstr "De tildelte IP-ene vil bli valgt deterministisk"

#: applications/luci-app-ocserv/luasrc/model/cbi/ocserv/main.lua:50
#: applications/luci-app-ocserv/luasrc/model/cbi/ocserv/user-config.lua:38
msgid ""
"The authentication method for the users. The simplest is plain with a single"
" username-password pair. Use PAM modules to authenticate using another "
"server (e.g., LDAP, Radius)."
msgstr ""
"Autentiseringsmetoden for brukerne. Den enkleste er vanlig med et enkelt "
"brukernavn-passord-par. Bruk PAM-moduler for å autentisere ved hjelp av en "
"annen server (f.eks. LDAP, Radius)."

#: applications/luci-app-ocserv/luasrc/model/cbi/ocserv/user-config.lua:45
msgid "The firewall zone that the VPN clients will be set to"
msgstr "Brannmursonen som VPN-klientene vil bli satt til"

#: applications/luci-app-ocserv/luasrc/model/cbi/ocserv/main.lua:116
msgid "The mask of the subnet above."
msgstr "Masken til undernettet ovenfor."

#: applications/luci-app-ocserv/luasrc/model/cbi/ocserv/main.lua:144
#: applications/luci-app-ocserv/luasrc/model/cbi/ocserv/user-config.lua:123
msgid ""
"The routing table to be provided to clients; you can mix IPv4 and IPv6 "
"routes, the server will send only the appropriate. Leave empty to set a "
"default route"
msgstr ""
"Rutingtabellen som skal gis til klienter; du kan blande IPv4- og IPv6-ruter,"
" serveren vil bare sende de riktige. La stå tomt for å angi en standardrute"

#: applications/luci-app-ocserv/luasrc/model/cbi/ocserv/main.lua:57
